    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "omg my stomach is hurting so bad right now. its like a really sharp, stabbing pain in the lower right side and i feel super nauseous. i think i might need to go to the hospital but i'm kinda scared of the bill/wait... do u think it could just be bad gas or something? is there anything i can take right now at home to make it stop so i dont have to go in? maybe a strong laxative or some extra strength antacid?",
